{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103370","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103370","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1710337001:1":{"text":"미스릴 상회 상담원입니다. 무엇을 도와드릴까요?","source_cn":"秘银工号1095，很高兴为您服务，您有什么需要的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x754E48F64172A853","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710337002:1":{"text":"그... 클레임 좀 걸려고요. 상품 포장이랑 실물이 달라요.","source_cn":"我……我要投诉。我要投诉你们的商品包装与实际产品不符。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE057389EFCED5D82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710337003:1":{"text":"어떤 제품에서 문제가 발생하셨을까요? 제품은 가지고 오셨나요?","source_cn":"请问是哪款产品出现了您所说的问题呢？有实物可以看下吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9800C5539AC5522A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710337004:1":{"text":"저희가 산 이 인형 말이에요. 분명 여우 인형이라고 적혀 있었는데, 드래곤 인형이 나왔잖아요!","source_cn":"我们买的这款玩偶，包装上明明是只狐狸，为什么打开以后变...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAA6CCFD38A248A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710337005:1":{"text":"아아, 여기 보시면 작은 글씨로 쓰여있답니다. “이미지는 참고용이며, 실제 상품을 기준으로 합니다”라고요.","source_cn":"哦哦，您请看，包装上有行小字写着，“图片仅供参考，产品...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x934609E85893E6F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710337006:1":{"text":"그리고 운이 정말 좋으시네요. 이건 1% 확률로 뽑으실 수 있는 히든 인형이거든요. 굉장히 높은 값에 거래되는 인형이라, 일반 여우 인형을 10개는 사실 수 있어요.","source_cn":"这位女士您很幸运啊！抽中了出现概率为百分之一的隐藏款！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E13DCA70ACE4922","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710337007:1":{"text":"그게... 정말이에요?","source_cn":"你说的……是真的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5385FCE900C53C6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710337008:1":{"text":"엄마, 그럼 우리 하나 더 사자! 나 여우 인형도 갖고 싶어!","source_cn":"既然这样，妈妈，我们再买一个吧！我还想再要一个狐狸的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79AA0ECA31101296","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:秘银接待员诺拉":{"text":"미스릴 안내원 노라","source":"秘银接待员诺拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:犹豫的女士":{"text":"망설이는 여인","source":"犹豫的女士","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:兴奋的孩子":{"text":"신이 난 아이","source":"兴奋的孩子","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}